      "text": "CONTROLLER (KRaft quorum)\nTracks which brokers are alive, elects a new partition\nleader when a broker dies, stores cluster metadata",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2GGLk9IVwVU86JHHK3hun",
      "originalText": "CONTROLLER (KRaft quorum)\nTracks which brokers are alive, elects a new partition\nleader when a broker dies, stores cluster metadata",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
