      "seed": 1037703069,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2005149917,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795582713067,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How partitions work",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How partitions work",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MeG_-xm_xfhIXWp3-20Zk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 924,
      "y": 1232,
      "width": 499.6465759277344,
      "height": 191.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "asZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 908754099,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1356144499,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795582713067,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• A topic is split into PARTITIONS; each one is an\n  append-only log. More partitions = more parallelism.\n• Every event gets an OFFSET (0,1,2...) = its position.\n• Order is guaranteed ONLY inside one partition.\n• Same key => same partition: hash(key) % partitions,\n  so all events of one customer stay in order.\n• Each consumer group remembers its own committed offset.\n• Each partition has 1 LEADER + replicas on other brokers.\n  If the leader dies, an in-sync replica (ISR) takes over.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• A topic is split into PARTITIONS; each one is an\n  append-only log. More partitions = more parallelism.\n• Every event gets an OFFSET (0,1,2...) = its position.\n• Order is guaranteed ONLY inside one partition.\n• Same key => same partition: hash(key) % partitions,\n  so all events of one customer stay in order.\n• Each consumer group remembers its own committed offset.\n• Each partition has 1 LEADER + replicas on other brokers.\n  If the leader dies, an in-sync replica (ISR) takes over.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
